{
	"__schema" : "4.1",
	"__type" : "page",
	"children" : {
		"__type" : "snippets",
		"items" : [
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:51:13.987109+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:52:18.461277+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "JPq1+Tf+DQChXxdfDyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "As we have seen, the verifier can still find counterexamples where O eventually loses, even when our b-program correctly blocks every direct winning move by X.\t\t\t"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:52:21.149429+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:53:32.309141+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "HiNZ/jf+DQCkCT16Dyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "The reason is that in our implementation the **O player only blocks immediate threats** (lines where X has two in a row) and plays randomly otherwise."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:53:35.824431+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:54:35.833436+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "XJbMAjj+DQCne81jDyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "This makes O **reactive rather than strategic**. It never **anticipates future forks** — positions where a move now could **prevent X from creating two winning options later**."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:54:40.102561+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:54:45.694694+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "zWShBjj+DQCnyF9/Dyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "##What is a fork?"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:34:28.15288+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:44:40.434339+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "SoJkvjf+DQCbVFiJDyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "In Tic Tac Toe, a **\"fork\"** is a situation where a player creates two simultaneous threats — that is, two separate lines where they could win on their next move. This forces the opponent (O) into an impossible situation: no matter which threat O blocks, X can win with the other.\t"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:44:59.288752+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:45:11.556257+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "7eAC5Df+DQCcLsD5Dyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "For example, consider this board:"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:45:20.405038+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:49:33.598195+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "URZF5Tf+DQCcbApCDyq4qA=="
				},
				"code" : "Gt4BpTicTacToeGame\r\twithEvents: {\r\t    Gt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'X'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 1.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 1} asDictionary.\r\t\tGt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'O'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 2.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 2} asDictionary.\r\t\tGt4BpEvent new\r\t\t\tname: 'moveAccepted';\r\t\t\tdata: {'player' -> 'X'.\r\t\t\t\t\t'row' -> 3.\r\t\t\t\t\t'col' -> 3} asDictionary}"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T18:50:09.251483+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:11:51.221044+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "9oh89jf+DQCg1noWDyq4qA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "If X plays next in the right of the top row, X creates a fork — now having two potential winning lines (one along the top row, another along the right column). O can block only one of them, and X will win with her next move."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:11:56.526542+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:11:57.577606+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "2PRnRDj+DQC7/JTIAiLQYA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Design note"
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:12:00.207173+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:12:53.073195+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "yx6gRDj+DQC8Bc+AAiLQYA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "As we've done until now, we have decided to follow a **pure BP-style approach** — keeping the system fully **event-driven and stateless**, where **no component has global board awareness**, but rather behavior emerges from the collective constraints of many small, local b-threads."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:13:13.273341+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:13:38.655912+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "I0+ESDj+DQC9gLEwAiLQYA=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Instead of a **single thread that reasons globally**, we are going to define **multiple simple, situation-specific threads** that together describe correct behavior."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:13:51.521691+02:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2025-10-23T19:13:57.115767+02:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
